                  <nc xml:id="m-a2e8729c-691e-45ea-95dc-824f4d3f892d" pname="c" oct="4" /><nc xml:id="m-34e9c7b7-7987-48af-8927-6d097a5652ba" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-72c8de5b-f99b-449c-a850-ffdb858e1141" facs="#m-e0133eaf-c217-4791-bc28-1f98bd6696c9" pname="b" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-1ef2422e-b191-4ea9-9ce1-edfffdfd4d97"><lg xml:id="m-d8fdee13-f357-4777-8d6f-6a4d7a2ea4e3"><l xml:id="m-1d243045-0743-49e2-90ad-8b0feea9dc17" facs="#m-00825975-3f5f-4f7f-9db2-1baf4f5ef22c" label="ambiguous">1544</l><l xml:id="m-3dbc1fb4-6045-4591-bf33-9da5986b7777" facs="#m-f27dc6d4-5ec5-42bf-99c8-40de10711b99" label="ambiguous">Iuly s.</l><l xml:id="m-43171a38-3e79-47f9-9018-fc458b2659b8" facs="#m-6f0a7341-471b-41e4-90ce-0fed1146209a" label="lyrics-like">in per-su-a-sibí-libus humá- nae sapi-én- ti-ae vér¬</l><l xml:id="m-251f5be4-609f-4c32-b9af-8326b35edb6c" facs="#m-804a925a-1658-48e1-a317-dd060270bf23" label="ambiguous">bis,</l><l xml:id="m-ca3526f4-f672-482a-9d11-78ced5535a60" facs="#m-b41597af-d99a-4754-86f5-b95f2279595b" label="lyrics-like">sed in ostensi-o-ne spí¬ ri-tus et vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4c8b6ad-792b-454a-a2db-da5a154c76f6" facs="#m-f56364fb-2023-4d9c-a308-138e318b4181" label="lyrics-like">tú- tis. Ps. Confi-tébor tí-bi, Dómine, in tóto córde mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-30d08a8a-e43c-4548-b54f-79cd06e07331" facs="#m-19866295-d503-4f72-8ae5-fd59b9efc8a4" label="lyrics-like">*in consí-li-o justórum et congre-ga-ti-óne. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-60095294-18aa-4098-8cde-3b68a7caf6a5" facs="#m-a4f55352-84ad-46e7-878c-04808e224d5c" label="lyrics-like">ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7ad1a6d1-7799-4888-a819-2f7214484946" facs="#m-d9982986-1803-4f3d-ab55-18e4d1874ed6" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-14e5ed93-b73c-466f-b363-e1b48ec97338" facs="#m-11c76551-7c76-4dd1-b63c-2307277bd217" label="lyrics-like">LAC nos, Dómine Deus, super-! mirabiliter erudítus, *novas in Ec¬</l><l xml:id="m-bcb25f7f-d531-4852-b216-d70900b1d0bc" facs="#m-f36ea46e-1a8d-4da2-84ae-053ace849b15" label="lyrics-like">Feminéntem Jesu Christi scién-clésia tua clericórum et virginum</l><l xml:id="m-00cea426-271e-4904-ac48-300d913b5a8c" facs="#m-c4658fba-9549-47a8-ba0a-f06f26571ca9" label="lyrics-like">tiam, spiritu Pauli Apóstoli, edisce¬</l><l xml:id="m-f4ba98da-7643-40fa-b83c-586469fa92aa" facs="#m-9ff0a976-4e34-49d8-9050-4fe745736128" label="lyrics-like">familias congregávit. Per eúmdem</l><l xml:id="m-4bc72065-e8b9-434d-b254-3fbfad99c312" facs="#m-6b8c6c98-ec83-4220-8013-96bcafc7a311" label="lyrics-like">re; t qua beátus Antónius María ! Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-653f811b-2d6f-4d5c-9157-c08da7030d1a" facs="#m-c47cf319-8396-4995-8614-bd95bea6fa63" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Octave of SS. Peter and Paul, p. 1519.</l><l xml:id="m-fe46b770-9fd3-476a-bf09-237d0bc1e9fe" facs="#m-bef80cb2-7470-42b4-ae32-11275658c0ff" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Timotheum. 1. Tim. ".</l><l xml:id="m-84eb59b3-7804-4769-9995-73c6e3e8f003" facs="#m-3d6128a3-5463-4bc3-badb-b13972be149c" label="lyrics-like">(VAríssime: Pletas ad ómnia útilis ] in castitáte. Dum vénio, atténde</l><l xml:id="m-01c2655e-34a1-4761-9b23-5f3e7f9944ff" facs="#m-6f6cdadc-6877-4841-8fc5-e91ead1d98dd" label="lyrics-like">Lest: promissiónem habens vitae,</l><l xml:id="m-007f670e-7cdd-4806-8533-d5056bf52e4d" facs="#m-5ebb07f7-d346-4c3d-a918-af2cee826ff3" label="lyrics-like">lectióni, exhortatióni et doctrinae.</l><l xml:id="m-efa06ce4-b0c8-4e84-9bc8-8c0b8a881803" facs="#m-f450ba9b-d4eb-4f55-a4ed-02132277d942" label="lyrics-like">quae nunc est, et futúrae. Fidélis</l><l xml:id="m-74f18ae3-0d56-44c1-bb53-0c23ee80172d" facs="#m-9ce375e7-d1a9-4a9c-baca-329f17d55dca" label="lyrics-like">Noli negligere grátiam, quae in te</l><l xml:id="m-2256cedc-fff6-49a9-8870-7d3eb9a042b7" facs="#m-468c83ca-b00e-4f4b-a2b0-40271412acb2" label="ambiguous">est, quae data est tibi per prophe¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7ce9c47-2d3f-4100-8196-1d7c26b2b176" facs="#m-364d540d-8979-4979-87f9-4cb4e3e12c2f" label="lyrics-like">sermo et omni acceptióne dignus.</l><l xml:id="m-1f0ad046-c0be-4c53-9446-c2e52eb388da" facs="#m-117a1a9b-c0a2-4112-93be-e5b3ca768f65" label="lyrics-like">In hoc enim laborámus et male¬</l><l xml:id="m-0200b0c3-51cb-4792-88e2-3a7d23c10a29" facs="#m-a5463d53-61a0-4c04-80e2-6fab89bb99f5" label="lyrics-like">tíam, cum impositióne mánuum</l><l xml:id="m-3d8c8615-1c55-4729-9910-9eca9c94b6d1" facs="#m-3a2094bb-ae0c-4a1b-84ce-1e53e2c16c0d" label="lyrics-like">dícimur, quia sperámus in Deum</l><l xml:id="m-b26f42b6-476d-4f74-9f53-68272c24e336" facs="#m-b8994e50-487b-4df9-8beb-d20f134516a7" label="lyrics-like">presbytérii. Haëc meditáre, in his</l><l xml:id="m-943aaae3-6d7d-49d0-9a50-be56db6fc4b4" facs="#m-d0e0ce43-201f-41f0-aafb-5fe0ea62b488" label="lyrics-like">vivum, qui est Salvátor ómnium</l><l xml:id="m-822ed1e7-a569-475a-861c-e3a01db6d66b" facs="#m-bf0e50b1-08d1-43d8-b1fa-fc78fb5c696a" label="lyrics-like">esto: ut proféctus tuus maniféstus</l><l xml:id="m-98c35ed1-2391-4b16-b5a0-db233a5b2663" facs="#m-8ab0381c-2b1a-4606-b81d-6146b0ad292a" label="lyrics-like">hóminum, máxime fidélium. Praé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3166102-30bd-4dae-bbe3-74a79b5c5697" facs="#m-9a3b076c-1fd7-4e5d-8061-78d6e8065386" label="lyrics-like">sit ómnibus. Atténde tibi et doctri¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ba648a1-cba8-4aa7-bd99-9e4e764f1a19" facs="#m-a9cd13f6-2ff6-4af8-be59-0ba988291539" label="lyrics-like">nae: insta in illis. Hoc enim fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb6efae0-d7cb-4bfc-a204-afe81ed5aa57" facs="#m-5334cf50-62ba-4606-84c7-83d5b3f2e016" label="lyrics-like">cipe haec, et doce. Nemo adolescén¬</l><l xml:id="m-9af1946b-6686-43ce-b24e-6b6e640fe956" facs="#m-94490d88-599f-4557-99dd-390aeaa4f7dd" label="lyrics-like">ciens, et teípsum salvum fácies, et</l><l xml:id="m-5893caeb-63ca-47af-afd8-443469169663" facs="#m-09233368-169d-4bfa-a968-cdcff7640ef1" label="lyrics-like">tiam tuam contémnat: sed exém¬</l><l xml:id="m-edf71866-1029-47a4-b525-42644d9d0b76" facs="#m-3bf61e1d-a604-46a9-aa52-5e1dbc46f604" label="lyrics-like">plum esto fidélium in verbo, in</l><l xml:id="m-87d9958d-0eb4-4c06-87e4-7b345a5b0c5b" facs="#m-ef06c914-75d7-4cdd-b7dc-535132514732" label="lyrics-like">eos qui te áudiunt.</l><l xml:id="m-91d75288-04a5-424d-9a41-9dc1abe678c7" facs="#m-9ab34c8e-2d92-41c3-94a2-96e28582c3c2" label="lyrics-like">conversatióne, in caritáte, in fide,</l><l xml:id="m-7ffee967-ae56-4c57-8837-6602f98952fc" facs="#m-92230f67-e5ab-4d3c-b88f-0eec4f03dc73" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-80a5d3f8-4208-49ba-9e8b-fa64a9e94a86" facs="#m-bb7655b0-704d-4479-81d7-78d04b61a956" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-1a87d883-bc72-451b-885c-17c9c491da12" facs="#m-bb715318-8721-480c-9aeb-d60c9322f393" label="ambiguous">T</l><l xml:id="m-4b10e969-d482-419b-a75a-2b456f1e493c" facs="#m-5bcb3831-f7e5-4885-a435-bc270db88f58" label="lyrics-like">Estis míhi est Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f6ebadb8-8a36-4ef5-bf45-31c6a12ab4ac" facs="#m-cc45ebb6-2371-4702-b427-9f9a6c7ff435" label="lyrics-like">us, * quo mó-do cúpi-am</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>